  "description": "Style resolution and page layout for DocWright: flattens document defaults, styles, numbering and theme into concrete formatting, then produces positioned pages — line breaking, tab stops, page and column breaks, table row breaking and repeated headers, floating objects and text wrapping, headers, footers and notes. Includes font preflight, which reports the substitutions a document would need before you pay for a conversion. Most users should install the DocWright package instead, which includes this one.",
